Note on third-party assets: this licence covers the plugin's own source code.
The plugin downloads (it never redistributes) two things it did not write:

  - an ffmpeg build, from the source recorded in `SOURCE.json` under the shared
    plugin home, under that build's own licence (GPL);
  - a YOLOv8n ONNX export, from the source recorded in
    `~/.dsh-plugins/models/yolo/SOURCE.json`, under the licence recorded there
    (AGPL-3.0 upstream). The OCR engine, when a sibling `dsh-ocr` checkout
    provides one, is licensed by that plugin.
